---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="How this site is built" description="Architecture, delivery pipeline and latency decisions behind this portfolio.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>How this site is built</h1>
    <p>A static site, built once and served from a global CDN. There is no server to wait on, so most of the latency work is about sending less.</p>

    <div class="diagram" tabindex="0">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 760 250" role="img" aria-label="Delivery pipeline: git push to GitHub Actions to Cloudflare Pages CDN to visitor. Demo APIs run separately on a Docker VPS and are linked, not loaded.">
        <defs><marker id="a" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="var(--ink)"/></marker></defs>
        <rect class="box" x="10" y="30" width="150" height="70" rx="6"/><text x="85" y="62" text-anchor="middle">git push</text><text class="sub" x="85" y="82" text-anchor="middle">GitHub, main</text>
        <rect class="box" x="210" y="30" width="170" height="70" rx="6"/><text x="295" y="62" text-anchor="middle">GitHub Actions</text><text class="sub" x="295" y="82" text-anchor="middle">check, build, Lighthouse</text>
        <rect class="box" x="430" y="30" width="150" height="70" rx="6"/><text x="505" y="62" text-anchor="middle">Cloudflare Pages</text><text class="sub" x="505" y="82" text-anchor="middle">global CDN</text>
        <rect class="box" x="630" y="30" width="120" height="70" rx="6"/><text x="690" y="70" text-anchor="middle">Visitor</text>
        <path class="arrow" d="M160 65H208" marker-end="url(#a)"/><path class="arrow" d="M380 65H428" marker-end="url(#a)"/><path class="arrow" d="M580 65H628" marker-end="url(#a)"/>
        <rect class="soft" x="430" y="150" width="320" height="70" rx="6"/><text x="590" y="182" text-anchor="middle">Demo APIs (Django, Docker, VPS)</text><text class="sub" x="590" y="202" text-anchor="middle">linked from projects, not loaded by the page</text>
        <path class="soft" d="M690 100V150"/>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <h2>Decisions</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Static output with Astro.</strong> Pages are prebuilt HTML. The home page ships no JavaScript framework.</li>
      <li><strong>Self-hosted fonts.</strong> No third-party font request, so no extra connection before text renders.</li>
      <li><strong>Immutable caching.</strong> Hashed assets are cached for a year, so repeat visits load from cache.</li>
      <li><strong>Demo APIs stay off the critical path.</strong> They run on a separate host and may cold-start, so the site never waits on them.</li>
      <li><strong>Quality gates in CI.</strong> Every pull request runs type checks, a build, and Lighthouse before it can merge.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Delivery process</h2>
    <p>Trunk-based Git with pull requests, preview deployments for each pull request, and automatic deploys on merge to main. Each significant choice is recorded as a short decision record in the repository under <code>docs/adr</code>.</p>

    <h2>Performance</h2>
    <p>Lighthouse and load-time results will be posted here after the first production measurements.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
